## 新頁模板（複製起點）

**純 ACS 四 Tab（SMART / KPI / 8020 級）**：

```
church_planning/Church_Governance_{NAME}.html    # data-strategic-default="intro"
church_planning/js/tool_packs/{id}_pack.js
church_planning/js/{id}_acs_shell.js             # 可選 *_viz.js / *_pastoral_desk_content.js
church_planning/js/strategic_acs_unified_boot.js # 頁尾 initPage('{id}')
tests/test_{id}_pack.py
```

**恩賜／path_cards（SHAPE 級）**：

```
church_planning/{id}-*-assessment.html
church_planning/js/tool_packs/{id}_pack.js       # path_cards / fit_note
tests/test_gift_packs_smoke.py 或 test_{id}_pack.py
# 確認 ministry_path_bridge 仍綠
```

**混合殼（SWOT 級）**：

```
church_planning/Church_Governance_{NAME}_matrix.html
  · 頭部 strategic-tab-* + swot_acs_shell（A 軌）
  · B 軌 Vue #app 保留
  · 頁尾：unified_boot + initPage('swot')；Vue mount 不刪
```

**CRM 排水（治理链末端）**：

```
church_planning/js/governance_crm_bridge.js      # 旗標 SSOT
church_ministry/guide_crm_journey_hub.html       # #crmEntryBanner
church_ministry/js/crm_journey_common.js         # filterMatch 行為鎖
```

